  "interpretation": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><strong>Concentration of IgG in IU/ml</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><strong>Class</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><strong>Level of The specific IgG</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">&lt;1.0</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">0</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">Cilinically insignificant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">1.0 - 2.0</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">0-1</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">Low</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">&gt; 2.0 - 3.5</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">1</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">&gt; 3.5</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">&gt;1</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\">High</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>1. Results need to be correlated clinically.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>2. Food intolerance is IgG mediated hypersensitivity, so-called Type II and Typer III reaction. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>3. Definition and quantitative measurement of allergen-specific IgG concentrations have a great importance for diagnosis and investigation of food intolerance reactions for the selection of adequate therapy; for differentiation of some types of allergies in combination with other methods can be used to control the effectiveness of allergen-specific immunotherapy.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
